### ========================================
### 行李寄存系统 - 接口测试
### ========================================

### 基础地址
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json


### ========================================
### 1. 认证接口
### ========================================

### 1.1 用户注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "测试用户"
}

### 1.2 用户登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 保存登录返回的token（手动复制到下面的变量）
@token = mock-token-123456


### ========================================
### 2. 用户接口（需要登录）
### ========================================

### 2.1 获取当前用户信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.2 创建订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "cellId": 1
}

### 2.3 查询个人订单列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/my?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.4 查询订单详情（替换 {id} 为实际订单ID）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.5 验证取件码（替换 {id} 为实际订单ID）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/pickup/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pickupCode": "690373"
}

### 2.6 完成取件（替换 {id} 为实际订单ID）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### ========================================
### 3. 管理员接口（需要ADMIN角色）
### ========================================

### 3.1 查询所有订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.2 按状态筛选订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders?page=1&size=10&status=STORED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.3 获取所有计费规则
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/price-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.4 修改计费规则（替换 {id} 为实际规则ID）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/price-rules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "unitPrice": 2.50,
  "freeMinutes": 20,
  "unitMinutes": 60,
  "capAmount": 25.00,
  "enabled": 1
}

### 3.5 处理异常订单（替换 {id} 为实际订单ID）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "targetStatus": "COMPLETED"
}

### 3.6 获取统计数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### 4. 异常测试
### ========================================

### 4.1 未登录访问（应该返回401）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/my

### 4.2 错误取件码验证
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/pickup/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pickupCode": "999999"
}

### 4.3 空取件码验证
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/pickup/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pickupCode": ""
}